ard bento-card--companies" data-bento-card data-companies-card data-companies-target="100"> <div class="bento-card-header"> <p class="bento-kicker">Customers</p> </div> <div class="bento-companies"> <div class="bento-companies-count" data-companies-count>0</div> </div> <p class="bento-companies-body">
From Nasa to Ticketmaster, the best-known organisations on the
								planet.
</p> <div class="bento-companies-logos" aria-hidden="true"> <div class="bento-nasa-badge"> <div class="bento-earth"></div> </div> </div> </article> <!-- Demo stack swaps between terminal and portal preview states. --> <div class="bento-demo-stack" data-demo-cards> <div class="demo-stack-viewport"> <article class="bento-card bento-card--demo demo-stack-card demo-stack-card--terminal" data-bento-card> <div class="demo-card-header"> <p class="bento-kicker">BrowserPod: Node.js REPL</p> <span class="demo-meta" data-bp-status>Booting…</span> </div> <div class="demo-terminal" data-bp-terminal></div> <button class="demo-swap" type="button" data-demo-swap>Launch Express.js</button> </article> <article class="bento-card bento-card--demo demo-stack-card demo-stack-card--preview" data-bento-card> <div class="demo-card-header"> <p class="bento-kicker">
Instant, interactive and shareable code demos.
</p> <span class="demo-meta" data-bp-url>Waiting for portal…</span> </div> <div class="demo-preview"> <iframe data-bp-portal title="Express.js preview"></iframe> </div> <button class="demo-swap" type="button" data-demo-swap>Launch a portal</button> </article> </div> </div> <!-- Mesh card: lightweight canvas wireframe + synchronized logo parallax. --> <article class="bento-card bento-card--mesh" data-bento-card data-mesh-card> <div class="bento-card-header"> <p class="bento-kicker">Sandboxes</p> <h3>Code sandboxes <br>for AI agents.</h3> </div> <p class="bento-body">
Run untrusted code,<span class="bento-body-break-mobile"><br></span> safely sandboxed<span class="bento-body-break-mobile"><br></span> in the browser.
</p> <div class="bento-widget bento-mesh" aria-hidden="true"> <canvas class="bento-mesh-canvas" data-mesh-canvas aria-hidden="true"></canvas> <div class="bento-mesh-logo" aria-hidden="true"> <img src="/ai_stars.png" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="61" height="61"> </div> </div> </article> <!-- Infra card: wireframe mesh routes client compute into a shared matrix. --> <article class="bento-card bento-card--infra" data-bento-card> <div class="bento-card-header"> <p class="bento-kicker">Infinitely scalable infra</p> <h3>Leverage client-side compute.</h3> </div> <p class="bento-body">
