								locality, at a fraction of cloud costs.
</p> <div class="bento-widget bento-infra-grid" aria-hidden="true"> <svg class="bento-infra-svg" viewBox="0 0 320 180" role="presentation"> <g class="mesh-surface" aria-hidden="true"> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-frame" d="M156 24 L286 44"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-frame" d="M152 52 L282 72"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line" d="M148 80 L278 100"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line" d="M144 108 L274 128"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-frame" d="M140 136 L270 156"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-frame" d="M156 24 L140 136"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line" d="M188 28 L172 140"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line" d="M220 32 L204 144"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line" d="M252 38 L236 150"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-frame" d="M286 44 L270 156"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-diagonal" d="M156 24 L270 156"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-diagonal" d="M188 28 L236 150"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-diagonal" d="M220 32 L204 144"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-diagonal" d="M252 38 L172 140"></path> <path class="mesh-surface-line is-diagonal" d="M286 44 L140 136"></path> </g> <g class="mesh-scans" aria-hidden="true"> <path class="mesh-scan mesh-scan--1" d="M156 24 L270 156"></path> <path class="mesh-scan mesh-scan--2" d="M188 28 L236 150"></path> <path class="mesh-scan mesh-scan--3" d="M252 38 L172 140"></path> </g> <g class="mesh-vertices" aria-hidden="true"> <rect class="mesh-vertex" x="154" y="22" width="4" height="4" style="--v-delay:0s;"></rect> <rect class="mesh-vertex" x="186" y="26" width="4" height="4" style="--v-delay:0.1s;"></rect> <rect class="mesh-vertex" x="218" y="30" width="4" height="4" style="--v-delay:0.2s;"></rect> <rect class="mesh-vertex" x="250" y="36" width="4" height="4" style="--v-delay:0.3s;"></rect> <rect class="mesh-vertex" x="284" y="42" width="4" height="4" style="--v-delay:0.4s;"></rect> <rect class="mesh-vertex" x="150"